{"id":"nf3d82194a27f","url":"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/register-now-wdc26-prague-early-bird-rates-end-thursday-4-june","title":"Register now for WDC26 in Prague before early bird rates end this Thursday 4 June","source":"FDI World Dental Federation","date":"2026-03-06T12:00:00.000Z","byline":"","image":"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=nbJ52tol","imageKind":"","imageBg":"","html":"<p>Prague is calling! From 4–7 September 2026, the global dental community will come together for the <strong>FDI World Dental Congress (WDC26)</strong> in one of Europe’s most captivating cities.</p> <figure> Image <picture> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plan_1x_xl/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=lnFHAvwI 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_xl/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=djVxa6Ff 2x\" type=\"image/png\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_lg/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=f35odhyS 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_lg/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=c0tNT6Eb 2x\" type=\"image/png\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_md/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=NXg7jG3k 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_md/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=usajNstX 2x\" type=\"image/png\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_sm/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=kYgB1mIm 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_sm/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=8suBCqBM 2x\" type=\"image/png\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=nbJ52tol 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_xs/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=-GN74uBU 2x\" type=\"image/png\"> <img src=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-06/Copy%20of%20wdc26%20prague%20website%20news%20%282%29.png?itok=nbJ52tol\" alt=\"WDC26_EB\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </figure> <p>Join colleagues from around the world for four days of high-level science, fresh perspectives, and valuable professional connections.</p>\n<p>The scientific programme will feature internationally recognized experts from across dentistry, delivering the latest knowledge, innovations, and practical insights shaping the future of oral health care.</p>\n<p><strong>Registration fees are available for a range of participant categories, including dentists, young dentists, students, and dental team members. Additional discounts are offered to participants from low- and lower-middle-income countries, helping make WDC26 accessible to the global dental community.</strong></p>\n<p>Register before the early bird deadline and be part of this exceptional international gathering.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://2026.world-dental-congress.org/registration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Information &amp; Registration</a></p>","kind":"full"}